{
  "id": "p32",
  "title": "The Racing Team's Quiet Season",
  "titleZh": "车队的休赛季",
  "topic": "港口小镇赛车队",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My crew builds a racing car in a cold workshop.",
        "zh": "我的车队在寒冷的车间里造一辆赛车。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We operate on a limited budget, and the work is constant.",
        "zh": "我们靠有限的预算运作，工作从不间断。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our driver is an athlete with a particular kind of courage.",
        "zh": "我们的车手是位运动员，带着一种特别的勇气。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A wealthy merchant funds us, but his interest is not peaceful.",
        "zh": "一位富商资助我们，但他的兴趣并不平和。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He wants a target, and his statement is clear.",
        "zh": "他想要一个目标，他的说法很清楚。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a gas leak forces us to escape the pit.",
        "zh": "接着一处煤气泄漏逼着我们逃出维修区。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "One particular crash left our driver with a missing memory.",
        "zh": "一次特别的撞击，让我们的车手少了一段记忆。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His therapy is hard, and he cannot ignore the pain.",
        "zh": "他的治疗很艰难，可他无法忽视疼痛。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A doctor gives a lecture on a specific kind of rest.",
        "zh": "一位医生讲了一堂关于某种特定休息的课。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We estimate six months, but the athlete wants a comeback now.",
        "zh": "我们估计要六个月，可这位运动员现在就想复出。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His emotional state is fragile, and he snaps at his mate.",
        "zh": "他情绪脆弱，冲着自己的同伴发起火来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We try to stimulate his spirit with a peaceful drive.",
        "zh": "我们试着用一次平静的驾驶来激发他的精神。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A dealer offers a contract, but the terms are attractive.",
        "zh": "一位经销商提供合同，条款很有吸引力。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The negotiation is long, and the cabinet stays locked.",
        "zh": "谈判拖得很长，柜子一直锁着。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our manager will not speculate, and he declares nothing.",
        "zh": "我们的经理不愿猜测，什么也不宣布。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A voter in the harbour asks about the team's future.",
        "zh": "港口的一位选民问起车队的未来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The explanation is simple, and the branch office agrees.",
        "zh": "解释很简单，分公司也同意了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We conclude the deal, and the atmosphere is generally calm.",
        "zh": "我们敲定了交易，气氛大体平静。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My father was a rebel, and he kept a dusty pile of parts.",
        "zh": "我父亲是个叛逆者，他留着一堆落满灰的零件。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A hearing begins, and a judge reads the verdict aloud.",
        "zh": "一场听证会开始，法官大声宣读裁决。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The verdict is fair, and one man steps aside in anger.",
        "zh": "裁决是公正的，只有一个人愤怒地退到一旁。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His related claim fails, and the court sets a rate.",
        "zh": "他相关的索赔失败，法庭定下了一个费率。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A fellow from engineering checks the dust on every part.",
        "zh": "一位工程部的同事检查每个零件上的灰尘。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Later we implement a strategic plan and move slightly ahead.",
        "zh": "后来我们落实了一项战略计划，稍稍走到了前面。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later the author writes about a cave below the old town.",
        "zh": "后来那位作家写到老城下面的一处洞穴。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A flexible interior makes the old car a living space.",
        "zh": "一个灵活的内饰让这辆旧车成了宜居的空间。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My partner and I acknowledge the decline in ticket sales.",
        "zh": "我和搭档都承认门票销量在下滑。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Somehow we motivate the team, and the mood begins to boil.",
        "zh": "不知怎么的，我们激励了全队，气氛开始沸腾。"
      }
    ]
  ],
